{"2527710": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "TEXNOPLAZM", "steam_appid": 2527710, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527710/extras/90d8a8ea369d3a2500c9a246ca300d12.poster.avif?t=1782406915\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527710/extras/90d8a8ea369d3a2500c9a246ca300d12.webm?t=1782406915\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527710/extras/90d8a8ea369d3a2500c9a246ca300d12.mp4?t=1782406915\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>TEXNOPLAZM</strong> is a first-person beat'em'up/shooter hybrid where <i>fists</i>, <i>melee weapons</i>, and <i>firearms</i> collide. <br>Rip weapons from enemies, switch combat styles on the fly, and chain movement with brutal takedowns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock powerful moves and passives as you tear through a gothic European cityscape — a future that never was.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527710/extras/e7dc5515226cb27528a2790cfc0f1d63.avif?t=1782406915\" width=1560 height=81 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Fight</strong> enemies by wielding their own weapons against them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Switch</strong> combat styles mid fight</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Blend</strong> movement and combat abilities for inventive takedowns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock</strong> special moves and passive abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Explore</strong> the gothic cityscape of Europe, in a future that never was</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Uncover</strong> your mysterious origins</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527710/extras/487305a1e8ba2d8b0f4def5a54c0be74.avif?t=1782406915\" width=1560 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Year 200X, somewhere in Europe.</strong><br>In a world where advanced magic works like technology, extraordinary feats are attainable for those who possess the right sorcerer code.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nestled in the urban jungle, a street gang traffics synthetic companions known in the underground as “<i>Dolls&quot;</i>. One of them<i> </i>follows her routine...until the moment she does not. <br><br>Without any directive to guide her, she fights purely on instinct, a machine now unbound by purpose.<br><br><i>  </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is the <i>Girl With No Name</i>, she is a <strong>Technoplasm</strong>.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527710/extras/b33432859a3179e547edd37c87b87b7a.avif?t=1782406915\" width=1560 height=505 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527710/extras/90d8a8ea369d3a2500c9a246ca300d12.poster.avif?t=1782406915\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527710/extras/90d8a8ea369d3a2500c9a246ca300d12.webm?t=1782406915\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527710/extras/90d8a8ea369d3a2500c9a246ca300d12.mp4?t=1782406915\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>TEXNOPLAZM</strong> is a first-person beat'em'up/shooter hybrid where <i>fists</i>, <i>melee weapons</i>, and <i>firearms</i> collide. <br>Rip weapons from enemies, switch combat styles on the fly, and chain movement with brutal takedowns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock powerful moves and passives as you tear through a gothic European cityscape — a future that never was.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527710/extras/e7dc5515226cb27528a2790cfc0f1d63.avif?t=1782406915\" width=1560 height=81 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Fight</strong> enemies by wielding their own weapons against them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Switch</strong> combat styles mid fight</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Blend</strong> movement and combat abilities for inventive takedowns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock</strong> special moves and passive abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Explore</strong> the gothic cityscape of Europe, in a future that never was</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Uncover</strong> your mysterious origins</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527710/extras/487305a1e8ba2d8b0f4def5a54c0be74.avif?t=1782406915\" width=1560 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Year 200X, somewhere in Europe.</strong><br>In a world where advanced magic works like technology, extraordinary feats are attainable for those who possess the right sorcerer code.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nestled in the urban jungle, a street gang traffics synthetic companions known in the underground as “<i>Dolls&quot;</i>. One of them<i> </i>follows her routine...until the moment she does not. <br><br>Without any directive to guide her, she fights purely on instinct, a machine now unbound by purpose.<br><br><i>  </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is the <i>Girl With No Name</i>, she is a <strong>Technoplasm</strong>.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527710/extras/b33432859a3179e547edd37c87b87b7a.avif?t=1782406915\" width=1560 height=505 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Punch enemies, take their weapons, and switch combat styles on the fly. Blend combat skills and movement into hectic first-person gun-fu based on three movesets for punches, melee weapons and firearms.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527710/header.jpg?t=1782406915", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527710/5b8ea3f0c8aeca7385f296eeca09dd3b4ab732ac/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782406915", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527710/5b8ea3f0c8aeca7385f296eeca09dd3b4ab732ac/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782406915", "website": "https://x.com/texnoplazm", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1 GB of VRAM with OpenGL 3.3 (GeForce GTX 630 or higher)<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Integrated soundcard<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> System requirements are subject to change.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum